1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
This symbol indicates that fender apron member is replaced at the same time.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
