<ptxt>
Install front door hinge reinforcement.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0073.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "127.881mm" ver = "02" gw = "277" gh = "346"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install new A-pillar outer panel to vehicle body and cut in stacked condition.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install A-pillar outer panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct continuous weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of continuous weld part.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Bend in metal tab (arrow) of A-pillar outer panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0074.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "145.596mm" ver = "03" gw = "444" gh = "396"/>
